eeded. \u2022 Provide and install ice and water shield around Chimney. \u2022 Provide and install ridge caps across the roof. \u2022 Provide and install Starter layer across the roof. \u2022 Caulking around flashing metal pipes and roof jacks. Home hardening work for transfer tax reduction", "840 HILLDALE Ave, BERKELEY CA 94708"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Building&TabName=Building&capID1=DUB26&capID2=00000&capID3=00IHB&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
